    <briefdescription>
<para>The data structure for the dependency graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that in this graph if there is an edge from A to B (A -&gt; B), then it means that B depends on A, and when the state of A is updated, node B should also be updated </para>
    </detaileddescription>
